# ─── Generated agent adapters ─────────────────────────────
# Written wholesale by .agents/scripts/sync.py (via bootstrap.sh) for the
# harnesses detected on this machine. Nothing harness-specific is committed:
# every file below is rendered from .agents/ per checkout and carries no
# hand-authored content. Do not hand-edit or commit these. Keep the list in
# step with sync.py's renderers — `sync.py check` fails if a renderer output
# is unignored or tracked, and CI fails if a bootstrap run leaves an untracked
# file behind.
/CLAUDE.md
/.mcp.json
/.claude/settings.json
/.claude/skills/
/.gemini/settings.json
/.cursor/mcp.json
/.codex/config.toml
/.vscode/mcp.json
/opencode.json
/kilo.jsonc
/.factory/mcp.json
/.qwen/settings.json
/.amp/settings.json
/.codebuddy/skills/

